                                                "sense_id": "e3cfcfb1-8706-3c7f-8161-c773aaf33212",
                                                "text": "Don’t call Major Pendennis an old cove, if you’ll ’ave the goodness, Lightfoot, and don’t call me an old cove, nether. Such words ain’t used in society; and we have lived in the fust society, both at ’ome and foring."
                                            },
